    <summary>Easily run research workloads in the cloud - 27 research domains with 20-minute tutorials</summary>
    <description><![CDATA[
# AWS Research Wizard

Easily run research workloads in the cloud with pre-configured environments for 27 research domains. No cloud expertise needed - just follow 20-minute tutorials.

## Key Features

- **27 Research Domains**: Genomics, Climate Modeling, Machine Learning, Materials Science, Neuroscience, and more
- **20-Minute Tutorials**: Step-by-step guides using real research data from AWS Open Data Registry
- **Real Research Data**: Tutorials use actual datasets like 1000 Genomes, ERA5 Climate Data, and TCGA Cancer Data
- **Cost Optimization**: Smart cost control with spot instances and automatic scaling
- **One-Command Setup**: Deploy complete research environments with a single command

## Research Domains Include

- Genomics & DNA Analysis
- Climate Modeling & Weather Prediction
- Machine Learning & AI
- Materials Science & Quantum Chemistry
- Neuroscience & Brain Imaging
- Astronomy & Astrophysics
- Cybersecurity Research
- Digital Humanities
- Drug Discovery
- Economics & Finance
- And 17 more...

## Quick Start

After installation:

```
aws-research-wizard config list              # See available research domains
aws-research-wizard deploy --domain genomics # Deploy a genomics environment
aws-research-wizard monitor                  # Monitor costs and usage
```

## Requirements

- AWS account with valid credentials
- Windows 10+ (64-bit)

## Documentation

Comprehensive tutorials and guides: https://researchwizard.app
